              "content": {
                "article": {
                  "body": "The Atmakaraka, the planet at the highest degree, is read as the soul-significator in Jaimini technique. Its sign and house placement, and the karakamsha it forms, carry particular weight for life direction.\n\nUnlike Parashari house lordship, karaka assignment changes chart to chart based purely on degree, making it a genuinely different lens on the same data."
