              "type": "reading",
              "durationMin": 12,
              "status": "published",
              "updatedAt": "2026-09-29T12:35:46.008Z",
              "objectives": [],
              "content": {
                "article": {
                  "body": "Planets are read as functional benefics or malefics depending on the chart they fall in, not fixed labels. Jupiter and Venus are natural benefics; Saturn, Mars, the Sun and the nodes are natural malefics, with Mercury’s nature following its company.\n\nA malefic in a good house can still support a life area it rules, while a benefic in a difficult house can strain it. Judge each placement on its own terms before generalising."
